vFM Player - MIDI launchers

SD folder: /vFM/midi/instruments

VMI files are small text launchers, not sound banks. live.vmi uses the profile chosen in the MIDI menu. Named VMI files can select OPL3_2, OPL3_4, YM2151, YM2413, YM2608 or PSG. Their banks belong in /vFM/midi/banks.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/midi/instruments

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
